rts John likes. This is because they would have to like both rock climbing and shooting, which contradicts the given information. Therefore, this option cannot be true.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct answer is **D) Half of his college classmates also like all the sports John likes**.\n</think>\n<answer>\nD) Half of his college classmates also like all the sports John likes.\n</answer>",
